+"""Company-local private personnel evidence and explicit review workflows.
+
+HR never changes operational membership, handovers, payroll or equipment records.
+Its files, audit snapshots and retry receipts live in independent private tables.
+Every read, mutation and retry rechecks the current named account and row rights.
+"""
