lass="card"><h2>No matching certificates</h2><p>${all.length?'Reset the filters to return to your accessible register.':canUse('certificates.edit')?'Add a register record, then attach its original source.':'No certificate records are available to this account.'}</p></section>`}</div></section><section id="cw92-detail" class="cw92-detail" aria-label="Selected certificate" tabindex="-1"></section></div><p class="small muted">Dates describe the supplied record, not certificate authenticity or equipment readiness. Draft records are visible to permitted certificate viewers. Unknown expiry is not a no-expiry declaration.</p>`;
